[[File:Ot010 o en.png]]
:''Max Cat Energy Increased!''
The '''Management Bible''' is the 11th and last [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]. It increases the player's max [[Cat Energy]]. Like all Treasures, it is able to stack with others, specifically the [[Future Tech]], the [[Dark Matter]], and other Management Bibles.

==Effect==
Each Management Bible increases max [[Cat Energy]] by a maximum +60.

When a player has activated Management Bible at 100% in all 3 chapters, max Cat Energy is increased by +180.

