==Trivia==
*In the Japanese version, the Management Bible's equivalent is the '''Southern Wind''' (南国の風).
**It is one of the only Treasures whose name wasn't changed at all between the Japanese and [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|original English versions]], since it doesn't refer to a specific location.
*The Management Bible has double the effect of the other Cat Energy Treasures.
